      "content": "Is DRAGON able to link fecal metabolomics with colon-biopsy transcriptomics for our IBS study? Both tables are complete and continuous, but the metabolomics came from the 2023 recruitment wave and the biopsies may have been taken from a different group of volunteers; I'm still waiting to hear from the clinic whether they're the same 58 people."
